.TH loom-postinstall 1  "loom-postinstall " 
.SH NAME
loom\-postinstall \- Idempotent installer. RPC\-free local action (IC\-CLI\-06)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBloom\-postinstall\fR [\fB\-\-skip\-chromium\fR] [\fB\-\-skip\-binaries\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Idempotent installer. RPC\-free local action (IC\-CLI\-06)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-chromium\fR
Skip the Chromium download + verification step
.TP
\fB\-\-skip\-binaries\fR
Skip the loom\-daemon / loom\-mcp / loom\-shim\-chromium download from the matching GitHub Release
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
